{"id":"521852a49020f617","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-semantics.md","title":"Second-Order Semantics","display":"df-so-semantics — Second-Order Semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-semantics","aliases":["57-df-so-semantics"],"display":"df-so-semantics — Second-Order Semantics","depends_on":["[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-so-formula]]","[[57-df-so-var]]","[[57-df-so-assignment]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-term-interpretation]]","[[57-df-modified-assignment]]","[[57-df-so-sentence]]","[[57-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-semantics — Second-Order Semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"433037f9b53db530\" href=\"?note=433037f9b53db530\" title=\"57-df-so-formula\">57-df-so-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06cd82e12837aa5\" href=\"?note=d06cd82e12837aa5\" title=\"57-df-so-var\">57-df-so-var</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9fd59242fb4200e\" href=\"?note=b9fd59242fb4200e\" title=\"57-df-so-assignment\">57-df-so-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"549899f7f232c7be\" href=\"?note=549899f7f232c7be\" title=\"57-df-modified-assignment\">57-df-modified-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span> 为关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq A^n\\)</span> 为实际关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\)</span>；两者不共用一个未区分的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。项解释、一阶赋值修改与二阶赋值修改分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"549899f7f232c7be\" href=\"?note=549899f7f232c7be\" title=\"57-df-modified-assignment\">57-df-modified-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b9fd59242fb4200e\" href=\"?note=b9fd59242fb4200e\" title=\"57-df-so-assignment\">57-df-so-assignment</a>。递归沿二阶有限公式树进行。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t=\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\">\\(\\vec t=\\langle t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow s^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models P(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in P^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models X(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in\\gamma(X),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi\\land(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\psi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi\\lor(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\psi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\forall X\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall R\\subseteq A^n\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma[X/R])\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\exists X\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists R\\subseteq A^n\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma[X/R])\\models\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(s\\doteq t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow s^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]=t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models P(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in P^{\\mathfrak A},\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models X(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(t_1^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\ldots,t_n^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta])\\in\\gamma(X),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi\\land(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\psi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)&amp;\\leftrightarrow((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi\\lor(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\psi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\forall x\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a\\in A\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\gamma)\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\forall X\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall R\\subseteq A^n\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma[X/R])\\models\\varphi),\\\\\n(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\exists X\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists R\\subseteq A^n\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma[X/R])\\models\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n((\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\gamma)\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不带赋值的满足按全称赋值读取。对于 FullSent²，真值独立于两类赋值；对于仅属于 Sent² 的公式，仍须全称量化二阶赋值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-formula","status":"resolved","id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-var","status":